    "name": "\u8c1c\u7269\u5bfb\u771f: Seeking the Truth",
    "steam_appid": 3794980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game with fragmented narratives, Mystery is a special journey that takes you through a chest of treasures to travel back in time, becoming a detective, finding out the truth of each case, and experiencing the strong, complex, and hidden emotions of different characters. Can you change your life and the lives of others and get back to reality?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to explore the evidence of the scene, question the characters present, analyze the clues and construct reasonable assumptions for logical reasoning, find out the clues of the case, figure out the relationship between the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters on the scene will lie to you, and there will be people who deliberately plant evidence on others. As a detective, you need to carefully distinguish the clues and use evidence to uncover the lies so as to obtain the truth and find out the murderer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragment the narrative, as you go deeper into the case, through the words of all the witnesses and suspects, and the evidence you find, piece together a complete story. Betrayal? Take advantage of? Or revenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle game with fragmented narratives, Mystery is a special journey that takes you through a chest of treasures to travel back in time, becoming a detective, finding out the truth of each case, and experiencing the strong, complex, and hidden emotions of different characters. Can you change your life and the lives of others and get back to reality?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/2ef959c7fd33fab90c6e82cdca470a98.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to explore the evidence of the scene, question the characters present, analyze the clues and construct reasonable assumptions for logical reasoning, find out the clues of the case, figure out the relationship between the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/eccae9eb44ee38b0a38e877831cd277f.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters on the scene will lie to you, and there will be people who deliberately plant evidence on others. As a detective, you need to carefully distinguish the clues and use evidence to uncover the lies so as to obtain the truth and find out the murderer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.poster.avif?t=1754972897\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.webm?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794980/extras/b8a8e1f0d4abc678f6e1976c5f606607.mp4?t=1754972897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragment the narrative, as you go deeper into the case, through the words of all the witnesses and suspects, and the evidence you find, piece together a complete story. Betrayal? Take advantage of? Or revenge?</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a fragmented narrative puzzle game, you through a treasure chest, shuttle to several different cases, you need to check evidence and ask the characters to find clues, finally find the truth. can you return to the original world? What is the story behind each person?",
